WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.188
The next day Julia and her family were gone.

2
00:00:09.189 --> 00:00:13.290
Robot was looking at a MechaTron comic.

3
00:00:13.291 --> 00:00:15.572
He heard stomping in the hall.

4
00:00:15.573 --> 00:00:18.770
Then Noly rushed into the room.

5
00:00:18.771 --> 00:00:23.404
She looked scared. "Robot! Where are you?"

6
00:00:23.405 --> 00:00:26.838
"I'm over here," Robot said.

7
00:00:26.839 --> 00:00:31.446
"Come quick!" Noly said. "We need your help.

8
00:00:31.447 --> 00:00:34.579
A toy is in trouble!"

9
00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:38.103
"Another chance to be a hero!" Robot thought.

10
00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:41.597
His lights flashed.

11
00:00:41.598 --> 00:00:53.458
"I'm coming right now!"

12
00:00:53.459 --> 00:00:56.924
Robot rushed behind Noly into the playroom.

13
00:00:56.925 --> 00:01:00.113
Everything was quiet.

14
00:01:00.114 --> 00:01:03.066
"Where is everyone?" Robot said.

15
00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:07.365
Suddenly all the toys appeared.

16
00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:12.232
"Surprise! Three cheers for Robot!"

17
00:01:12.233 --> 00:01:15.602
"What's all this?" Robot said.

18
00:01:15.603 --> 00:01:21.097
Horse smiled at Robot. "This is for you."

19
00:01:21.098 --> 00:01:26.074
"So, nobody is in trouble?" Robot said.

20
00:01:26.075 --> 00:01:28.771
"No," Horse said.

21
00:01:28.772 --> 00:01:33.212
"Noly just wanted to thank you for saving her."

22
00:01:33.213 --> 00:01:35.963
All the toys cheered again.

23
00:01:35.964 --> 00:01:38.515
They shouted Robot's name.

24
00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:44.553
"Just like everyone cheering for MechaTron," Robot thought.

25
00:01:44.554 --> 00:01:48.110
Music started playing.

26
00:01:48.111 --> 00:01:50.884
Toys began dancing.

27
00:01:50.885 --> 00:01:54.459
"Sorry for tricking you," Noly said.

28
00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:57.741
"But I wanted it to be a surprise."

29
00:01:57.742 --> 00:02:01.447
The little dinosaur stomped and danced.

30
00:02:01.448 --> 00:02:04.480
Robot looked at all the toys having fun.

31
00:02:04.481 --> 00:02:06.324
It was very loud.

32
00:02:06.325 --> 00:02:09.570
But Robot was getting a strange new feeling.

33
00:02:09.571 --> 00:02:13.517
His lights glowed a new color—yellow.

34
00:02:13.518 --> 00:02:16.432
Robot's foot began to tap.

35
00:02:16.433 --> 00:02:20.845
His body shook to the music.

36
00:02:20.846 --> 00:02:23.901
"Look, everyone!" a dinosaur said.

37
00:02:23.902 --> 00:02:27.010
"Ha-ha! Robot is dancing!"

38
00:02:27.011 --> 00:02:30.036
Everyone looked at Robot.

39
00:02:30.037 --> 00:02:33.542
"He's having fun!" Horse said.

40
00:02:33.543 --> 00:02:36.345
Robot suddenly felt embarrassed.

41
00:02:36.346 --> 00:02:38.955
His lights flashed red.

42
00:02:38.956 --> 00:02:42.291
"You're all too loud," Robot snapped.

43
00:02:42.292 --> 00:02:44.551
"And I hate parties!"

44
00:02:44.552 --> 00:02:53.007
He spun around and zoomed out.

